        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/a9a28c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-08-28T08:08:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>&nbsp;Imbued Vitality:&nbsp;&nbsp; Yes, that is exactly how the card works.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Ghostly Images:&nbsp;&nbsp; A little awkwardly worded, but yes,&nbsp; the effect of the One-Shot happens&nbsp;&nbsp; (Putting Fire Blast into play means Ra deals 1 target 5 fire&nbsp; damage).</p>",
