        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>The important difference to realize is that you can &quot;put a card into play&quot; even when you can&#39;t &quot;play cards,&quot; so you can use it even when an environment says you can&#39;t. On the other hand, Take Down (non-EE, at least) doesn&#39;t prevent Omnitron repairing drones or the Operative summoning underbosses.</p>",
