        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-12-04T21:49:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If IV leaves play they ongoings lose their 'target' status and revert to 'ordinary' ongoing cards.</p><p>If another ongoing enters play it is affected by IV and becomes like all the other ongoings/equipment out there, a target with 6HP as well as its base type.</p>",
